<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANI year loss A$213.19 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANI year loss A$213.19 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    22.99 vs 105.62</p>
<p>    Net			     loss 213.19 vs 80.38 profit</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		2.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		loss 198.55 vs 5.82 loss</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.97 vs 1.86</p>
<p>    Other income			 217.46 vs 26.52</p>
<p>    Tax				     37.49 vs 19.22</p>
<p>    Interest				51.91 vs 45.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  60.04 vs 56.72</p>
<p>NOTE: Abnormal loss was due to A$233.55 million writedown of Holter environmental engineering business in Germany.</p>
</text>
